@startuml
title Subfigure: #9 栈 push → executeMove → self-pop 时序

participant "main loop" as ML
participant "state.stack" as ST
participant "executeMove" as MV

ML -> ST : push(marker-1)
ML -> ST : push(move entry)
note over ST : length=2

ML -> MV : executeMove(entry)
activate MV
MV -> MV : resolve(from)
MV -> MV : write(to)
MV -> ST : pop self
deactivate MV

note over ST : length=1（恰好减 1）

note right of MV
  executeMove 内部完成 4 步：
  ① 验证 from/to 是合法 Address
  ② resolve 读 from 值
  ③ write 写到 to
  ④ 把自身从栈顶弹出
  失败时跳过 ③④
end note

@enduml
